---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../components/layout/Sidebar.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<MainLayout title="Installation | MCDG" description="Install the MCDG modpack for Minecraft 1.20.6 with Fabric and Java 21.">
  <div class="container page-layout">
    <Sidebar />
    <article class="content card">
      <h1>Installation</h1>

      <p>MCDG is a Fabric mod for Minecraft 1.20.6. You can install it as part of the bundled test pack or build it from source.</p>

      <h2>Requirements</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Component</th><th>Version</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Minecraft</td><td>1.20.6</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Fabric Loader</td><td>0.16.10 or compatible</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Java</td><td>21</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Client Installation</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Download the latest client test pack from the <a href="https://github.com/rbrambley/mcdg/releases">releases page</a>.</li>
        <li>Extract the archive into your Minecraft instance directory.</li>
        <li>Launch the instance with the Fabric profile.</li>
        <li>The MCDG-Test-Resources pack is built into the mod jar and auto-enabled.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Server Installation</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Download the latest server test pack.</li>
        <li>Stop the server and back up the server directory.</li>
        <li>Extract the server pack into the server directory.</li>
        <li>Start the server and verify MCDG loads in the console.</li>
        <li>Distribute the matching client pack to every player.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>For detailed Oracle Cloud setup, see the <a href={`${base}admin/server-setup/`}>Server Setup Guide</a> or the <a href="https://github.com/rbrambley/mcdg/blob/main/SERVER-SETUP-GUIDE.md">raw markdown doc</a>.</p>

      <h2>Building from Source</h2>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/rbrambley/mcdg.git
cd mcdg
./gradlew build</code></pre>
      <p>The built jar will be in <code>build/libs</code>.</p>

      <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Wrong Java version:</strong> MCDG requires Java 21. Older versions will fail to load.</li>
        <li><strong>Mismatched client/server packs:</strong> All players must use the same release ID.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing textures:</strong> The resource pack is bundled; do not delete it from the jar.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .content h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
